Ring 3 ABI. MicroPython is Copyright (c) 2013-2025 Damien P. George and
contributors, licensed under the MIT License.

Upstream source: https://github.com/micropython/micropython

The upstream MicroPython source tree is intentionally not committed to this
repository; the checked-in `c/mpy_port/` contains only the MiniOS portability
layer, build glue, frozen Python tools, and generated binary image.

